@startuml
skin rose
skinparam ArrowFontSize 12
skinparam StateFontSize 15

[*] --> YourData
state "Your data" as YourData
state "Demo" as Demo

YourData --> Demo : demo confirm\n[no unsaved changes]\nkeep your data aside,\nload the samples
Demo --> YourData : demo exit\nput your data back
YourData --> YourData : any other command\nsaved after a change
Demo --> Demo : any other command\nnothing is saved
@enduml
